OL,3,GNEWSACounty pubs declared best of their
OL,4,Akind in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Gloucestershire pubs have been
OL,7,Fdeclared the best of their kind in the
OL,8,Fcountry.
OL,10,FFollowing a few years of closure, the
OL,11,Frefurbished Dr Foster scooped the the
OL,12,FBest Town Pub title at the Great
OL,13,FBritish Pub Awards 2026, two years
OL,14,Fafter reopening on Gloucester Docks.
OL,16,FMeanwhile, The Plough Inn at Prestbury
OL,17,Fwon Best Family Pub, which owner Emma
OL,18,FGibbon said was a bonus for her team as
OL,19,Fhospitality had been a "tough industry"
OL,20,Fto work in.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
