OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pub awards are selected after an
OL,7,Funannounced in-person visit. Elsewhere
OL,8,Fin Gloucester, The Coach and Horses
OL,9,Ffinished as a finalist in the Community
OL,10,FPub of the Year category.
